nd-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/38px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/50px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Esther\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\">Lady Esther</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Xorn_Scales\" title=\"Salts of Xorn Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Extract_Pink_Salts_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Xorn_Scales\" title=\"Salts of Xorn Scales\">Salts of Xorn Scales</a> (procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Xorn_Scales\" title=\"Xorn Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png/20px-Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png/30px-Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png/40px-Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png/20px-Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Xorn_Scales_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Xorn_Scales\" title=\"Xorn Scales\">Xorn Scales</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Suspension</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If the affected creature is in an area which causes one of the relevant conditions, the condition will be removed but then immediately re-applied, even in turn-based mode.</li>\n<li>This potion removes any condition within the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">Blinded</a></span>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon